LRC(14) OPEN-Q-108  THREAD C: the 56 / tournament-enumeration bijection (opus)

==============================================================================
PART A -- the 'size 3' support-3 primitive relation TYPES
==============================================================================
Primitive support-3 coefficient vectors with |coef|<=2 (canonical sign):
  abs-multiset (1, 1, 1): 4 signed reps -> Schur (e_a+e_b=e_c)
  abs-multiset (1, 1, 2): 12 signed reps -> 3-AP (e_a+e_c=2e_b)
  abs-multiset (1, 2, 2): 12 signed reps -> other

=> EXACTLY 2 additive-energy types: Schur and 3-AP.  'size 3' relation = 1 of 2.
   So 56 is NOT '# support-3 relation types' (that is 2).  56 must be the
   number of distinct support-3 STRUCTURES (hypergraphs), not types.

